// fixture-256: S4 (#159) — partial profile, NEGATED predicate over absent axis → dep excluded
//
// A partial profile has MILPA_TARGET_PLATFORM=linux but NO MILPA_TARGET_ARCH.
// Member `member-a` declares a dep `archlib` gated on `when arch=(not)"arm64"`.
//
// Without the fix (Rust pre-S4): `any_match=false` for absent axis, then
// `!false = true` → dep INCORRECTLY INCLUDED.
//
// After the fix (both impls): absent axis is indeterminate ⇒ false for BOTH
// positive and negated predicates (resolver-semantics §3.C / §6).
//
// This is the NEGATED-predicate case and the cross-impl divergence guard.
// The positive-predicate case is in fixture-255.
workspace {
    member "member-a"
}
